Let text be "2e10".
Let last be the last position of text.
Let position be 0.
Let digits be 0.
Let expcount be 0.
Let exponent seen be 0.
Let valid be 1.
Repeat while position is at most last.
If character position of text is not 32, break.
Add 1 to position.

If position is at most last and (character position of text is 43 or character position of text is 45), add 1 to position.
Repeat while position is at most last and character position of text is at least 48 and character position of text is at most 57.
Add 1 to digits.
Add 1 to position.

If position is at most last and character position of text is 46.
Add 1 to position.
Repeat while position is at most last and character position of text is at least 48 and character position of text is at most 57.
Add 1 to digits.
Add 1 to position.

If position is at most last and (character position of text is 101 or character position of text is 69).
Set exponent seen to 1.
Add 1 to position.
If position is at most last and (character position of text is 43 or character position of text is 45), add 1 to position.
Repeat while position is at most last and character position of text is at least 48 and character position of text is at most 57.
Add 1 to expcount.
Add 1 to position.

If exponent seen is 1 and expcount is 0, set valid to 0.
Repeat while position is at most last.
If character position of text is not 32, set valid to 0, break.
Add 1 to position.

If digits is 0, set valid to 0.
If valid is 1, print true.
Otherwise, print false.
